command-description-language-add = Adds a language to the given entities with options to speak and understand.
command-description-language-remove = Removes a language from the given entities.
command-description-language-reset = Resets the given entities' languages to the specified language.
command-description-language-partial = Sets partial understanding of a language for the given entities.
command-description-language-block = Blocks speaking or understanding of a language for the given entities.
command-description-language-unblock = Unblocks speaking or understanding of a language for the given entities.

stories-command-language-error-remove-no-comp = Cannot remove language from entity without a language comp!
stories-command-language-error-reset-no-comp = Cannot reset languages from entity without a language comp!
stories-command-language-error-unblock-no-comp = Cannot unblock language for entity without a language comp!
